    <item>
      <title>End of Module Review</title>
      <link>https://curriculum.codeyourfuture.io/itp/onboarding/success/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://curriculum.codeyourfuture.io/itp/onboarding/success/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;c-note c-note--caution&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h4 class=&#34;c-note__title&#34;&gt;❗Caution&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;c-note__text&#34;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the end of Onboarding, you must enrol as a trainee. If you do not enrol as a trainee by the end of week 6, you will be removed from the ITP cohort.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you are removed from the cohort, you will not be allowed to keep attending class. You can apply to start again in the next cohort if you want.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-youve-achieved-your-learning-objectives-if-you-can&#34;&gt;🎯 You&amp;rsquo;ve achieved your learning objectives if you can:&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;ul class=&#34;c-objectives__list&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Explain to someone how we use prep, backlogs, day plans, and end of sprint/module review pages at &lt;span class=&#34;c-our-name&#34;&gt;CYF&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Track changes to data (your code) over time with Git and GitHub.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Validate data with HTML forms.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Analyse structured data with SQL in a spreadsheet.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Plan your new life as a tech professional.&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;announcer&#34; aria-live=&#34;polite&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-to-complete-_any_-module-you-must&#34;&gt;💯 To complete &lt;em&gt;any&lt;/em&gt; module, you must:&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;      &#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;ul class=&#34;c-objectives__list&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Do your work: complete all mandatory backlog issues&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;li class=&#34;c-objectives__item&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;      &lt;label&#xD;&#xA;        &gt;&lt;input&#xD;&#xA;          type=&#34;checkbox&#34; /&gt;Come to class&lt;/label&#xD;&#xA;      &gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/li&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;announcer&#34; aria-live=&#34;polite&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;  &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-to-complete-_this_-module-you-must&#34;&gt;✅ To complete &lt;em&gt;this&lt;/em&gt; module, you must:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Make a new issue on your own Coursework Planner.&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Follow this template for naming your issue: &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;COHORT_NAME&amp;gt; | Onboarding | &amp;lt;YOUR_NAME&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;On the issue, add:&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A screenshot showing that you &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Onboarding/issues/918&#34;&gt;attended a demo session with particular members of the CYF team present&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link to your &lt;em&gt;completed&lt;/em&gt; pull request for &amp;ldquo;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Onboarding/issues/17&#34;&gt;Wireframe to Web Code&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link to your &lt;em&gt;completed&lt;/em&gt; pull request for &amp;ldquo;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Onboarding/issues/19&#34;&gt;Form Controls&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Your Codewars username which you created when you &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Onboarding/issues/39&#34;&gt;joined Codewars&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A link showing you &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/CodeYourFuture/Module-Onboarding/issues/935&#34;&gt;completed &lt;strong&gt;at least 50% of the Onboarding katas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. This should be a link to your Codewars Progress Checker page in the form of: &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://codeyourfuture.github.io/Codewars-Progress-Checker/#YOUR_CODEWARS_USERNAME&#34;&gt;https://codeyourfuture.github.io/Codewars-Progress-Checker/#YOUR_CODEWARS_USERNAME&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Submit the issue link to step 1 of ITP on &lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://application-process.codeyourfuture.io/&#34;&gt;CYF Course Portal&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  href=&#34;https://forms.gle/vRuofa7aeL5DsbhGA&#34;&gt;Apply to enroll as a Trainee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;c-note c-note--note&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h4 class=&#34;c-note__title&#34;&gt;📝Note&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;c-note__text&#34;&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pull request is &lt;em&gt;completed&lt;/em&gt; when a volunteer has added the &amp;ldquo;Complete&amp;rdquo; tag. If nobody has reviewed your PR after one week, please ask on Slack in #cyf-code-review.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
